 * flame, Yakko an arcane sigil with a spark. Plain strings, no React: components/cyrus/icons/ModelGlyphs.tsx renders
 * them and scripts/cyrus/model-sigil-files.ts writes the same markup to public/cyrus/models/*.svg.
 *
